message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PiPER Dual-Arm Cube Transfer"
abstract: >-
  A bidirectional pick-and-place stack for two AgileX PiPER arms: two
  independent ACT policies (one per direction), a resident control loop that
  loads both models once and alternates directions, temporal ensembling at
  inference, and a Rerun telemetry path that does not block the 30 Hz control
  loop.
